  "question": "设数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 满足: $a_1 = 1, a_{n+1} = \\frac{a_n}{(n+1)(a_n+1)} (n \\geqslant 1)$ . 求极限 $\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} n! a_n$ .",
  "answer": "$a_{n} > 0 (n \\geqslant 1)$",
  "ref_source": "textbook:puheping_math_contest_v2",
  "techniques": [
    "递推数列",
    "极限计算"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "分析 考察 $\\frac{1}{a_{n+1}}$ ，容易得到其一阶递推式，从而得到 $a_n$ 的表达式，极限也就容易计算了."
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "利用归纳法易知 $a_{n} > 0 (n \\geqslant 1)$ . 由于"
      },
      {
        "id": "s3",
        "text": "\\begin{array}{r l} \\frac {1}{a _ {n + 1}} & = (n + 1) \\left(1 + \\frac {1}{a _ {n}}\\right) = (n + 1) + (n + 1) \\frac {1}{a _ {n}} \\\\ & = (n + 1) + (n + 1) \\left(n + n \\frac {1}{a _ {n - 1}}\\right) = (n + 1) + (n + 1) n + (n + 1) n \\frac {1}{a _ {n - 1}} \\\\ & = (n + 1) + (n + 1) n + (n + 1) n (n - 1) + (n + 1) n (n - 1) \\frac {1}{a _ {n - 2}} \\\\ & = \\dots = (\\dot {n} + 1)! \\left(\\sum_ {k = 1} ^ {n} \\frac {1}{k !} + \\frac {1}{a _ {1}}\\right) = (n + 1)! \\sum_ {k = 0} ^ {n} \\frac {1}{k !}. \\end{array}"
      },
      {
        "id": "s4",
        "text": "因此"
      },
      {
        "id": "s5",
        "text": "\\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} n! a _ {n} = \\lim _ {n \\rightarrow \\infty} \\left(\\sum_ {k = 0} ^ {n - 1} \\frac {1}{k !}\\right) ^ {- 1} = e ^ {- 1}."
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "$a_{n} > 0 (n \\geqslant 1)$",
    "techniques_used": [
      "递推数列",
      "极限计算"
    ]
  },
